    "STEP 1: Create a Firebase project at https://console.firebase.google.com",
    "STEP 2: Add an Android app with package name com.familyfinance.app",
    "STEP 3: Download the real google-services.json and replace app/google-services.json",
    "STEP 4: Enable Authentication (Email/Password + Google), Cloud Firestore, and Storage",
    "STEP 5: Deploy rules/functions:  cd backend && npm install -g firebase-tools && firebase login && firebase deploy",
